{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的大面积白色粗体文字，字号最大、亮度最高；随后可能注意到右上角蓝色高亮的阶段目录，下半屏金色音符动画是次级视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只能初步看出一个人在亲密关系中很喜欢对方，希望对方保证以后也不会改变；具体处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"能扫到高兴、喜欢，隐约有不安，但幸福与疼痛交织的核心感受不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他真正害怕的是有一天对方不再需要自己；即使得到承诺，仍然担心幸福无法持续；他发现幸福中已经掺入悲伤，想收回心意反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，开头的关系处境、后面的失去恐惧和最后的幸福与悲伤需要继续读才能理解。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在多句中，要把前面的喜欢与担忧和后面的幸福里生出疼联系起来才能完整理解。\",\n    \"右上角目录有多条小字连续排列，当前阶段虽然有蓝色高亮，但字号较小，难以在第一眼承担核心信息的传达。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "87d65a25-f341-4cdd-bd1c-963bc9ee6df8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T015129190673Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:52:20.662822+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eeca1c637cde412f02849f42c7872936afed1c54b1c657d6329ab016c9ae51ef", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_se